  "correct_answer": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is decreasing in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;increasing in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;decreasing in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;increasing in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now plotting the graph of above function we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0002_adf26f510dc2.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 169px;\" /></p><p>Also,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now from above diagram area will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
